#: source/release-notes/rl-0.9.2.md:1
msgid "Release 0.9.2 (2005-09-21)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.9.2.md:3
msgid "This bug fix release fixes two problems on Mac OS X:"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.9.2.md:5
msgid ""
"If Nix was linked against statically linked versions of the ATerm or "
"Berkeley DB library, there would be dynamic link errors at runtime."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.9.2.md:8
msgid ""
"`nix-pull` and `nix-push` intermittently failed due to race conditions "
"involving pipes and child processes with error messages such as `open2: "
"open(GLOB(0x180b2e4), >&=9) failed: Bad         file descriptor at /nix/bin/"
"nix-pull line 77` (issue `NIX-14`)."
msgstr ""
